      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Janet Carroll Estate Agents proudly welcomes you to 97 Rowanbyrn, a charming four-bedroom detached family home, ideally positioned in one of South County Dublin`s most sought-after residential locations.\r\n\r\nSet within a peaceful, leafy cul-de-sac of detached homes, this much-loved property has been in the same family`s ownership since 1976 and has been well cared for throughout the years. Extending to approximately 91.6 sq. m. (986 sq. ft.), it offers an exciting opportunity to create a wonderful long-term family home, with excellent potential for further extension, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\r\n\r\nRowanbyrn enjoys a superb residential setting in the heart of Blackrock, an established and highly regarded location renowned for its quality of life. Quiet and mature, yet exceptionally well connected, it offers the best of both worlds peaceful surroundings alongside an outstanding choice of amenities close by. Blackrock DART station, local bus services and the QBC are all within easy reach, providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and the surrounding area, while the N11 Quality Bus Corridor and the M50 are also readily accessible. UCD Belfield and Trinity College are easily reached, with a direct bus connection also available to DCU.\r\n\r\nThe location suits an active lifestyle too, with a superb range of sporting and recreational facilities nearby, including tennis, rugby, football, swimming, running routes, cinemas, the library and lawn bowls.\r\n\r\nThe property is particularly well suited to family life, occupying a quiet position within a cul-de-sac of detached homes that provides additional parking, while a nearby green play area offers a wonderful space for children to enjoy.\r\n\r\nBlackrock and the surrounding area are renowned for their outstanding selection of educational facilities. Nearby schools include Carysfort National School, All Saints Church of Ireland, Blackrock College, St Andrew`s International School, Newpark Comprehensive School, Oatlands College and UCD Michael Smurfit Graduate Business School, while an Educate Together Secondary School is also under construction nearby, further enhancing the area`s appeal to families.\r\n\r\nMAIN FEATURES\r\n-Secluded rear garden\r\n-4-bedroom house \r\n-Owner occupied.\r\n-No management fees. \r\n-Partially double glazed to the front\r\n-Oil fired central heating. \r\n-Direct access to a green in the safe cul de sac for children\r\n-Close to many premier schools and creches \r\n-Off street parking\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\n \r\nEntrance Hall: c. 2.79m x 2.15m \r\n\r\nLigh oak flooring. Understairs storage. Plumbed for a WC. \r\n\r\nLiving Room / Dining Room: c. 6.12m x 4.21m \r\n\r\nLight Oak flooring. Attractive brick fireplace with copper canopy. Double doors out to rear garden. Door to:\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room: c. 2.96m x 5.59m \r\n\r\nRange of fitted presses and cupboards. Single drainer stainless steel sink unit. Formica worktops, tiled splashbacks. Nordmende cooker. Belling extractor fan. Hoover washer/Dryer. Integrated Zanussi dishwasher.Samsung fridge freezer. Light oak wood flooring\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\n\r\nShelved hot press with dual immersion. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c. 3.71m x 3.29m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 3.01m x 3.29m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: c. 2.71m x 3.34m\r\n\r\nStripped and polish timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: c. 3.76m x 3.34m \r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 1.62m x 2.85m \r\n\r\nBath with shower attachment. W.C., wash hand basin with fitted storage in matching suite. Light oak flooring\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nVery fine secluded rear garden in lawn with hedge and a variety of herbaceous and flowerbed borders. Lovley feature Eucalyptus tree. Outside tool shed with Firebird oil burner.\r\n\r\nSide passageway to front garden mainly in lawn with a large Crab-apple tree, hedge borders and flowering shrubs.\r\n\r\nDIRECTIONS\r\n \r\nGoogle search Eircode A94 HY22 from your current location.\r\n \r\nVIEWING\r\n \r\nBy appointment with Andrew Quirke, on 086 3834703 or (01) 288 2020 or by email to andrew@janetcarroll.ie \r\n \r\nOFFERS\r\n \r\nOffer is to be sent by email to andrew@janetcarroll.ie\r\n \r\nIMPORTANT NOTICE\r\n \r\nJanet Carroll Estate Agents for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that: - (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and any other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of Janet Carroll Estate Agents has any authority to make or give any representations or warranty whatever in relation to this property.\r\n \r\nPLEASE NOTE\r\n \r\nPlease note we have not assessed any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided are for guidance only."
